OL,3,AHigher petrol and diesel prices push UK
OL,4,Ainflation to 3.6%
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrices have surged in recent months
OL,7,Fbecause of the US-Iran war, with the
OL,8,FBank of England raising interest rates
OL,9,Ffor the first time in three years
OL,10,Fearlier this month in a bid to slow
OL,11,Fprice rises.
